from cp21f.replay
# Branch m6-cresselia (docs/research/postgame.md §6): the Lunar Wing event,
# waking the boy without catching Cresselia. From cp21f's end (its National Pokédex); kept setup: the warp to the
# sailor Eldritch's door in Canalave. The house's on-transition starts the event (VAR_LUNAR_WING_EVENT_STATE 1, the boy
# in bed); talking to him: state 2. Eldritch at the dock sails to Fullmoon Island; in the forest Cresselia's portrait
# (draw_pokemon_preview), then it flies off: activate_roaming_pokemon ROAMING_SLOT_CRESSELIA, the Lunar Wing left
# behind, FLAG_MET_CRESSELIA. Back in Canalave the wing wakes the boy: state 3, the wing used up; Cresselia roams on.
warp platinum:MAP_HEADER_CANALAVE_CITY_SAILOR_ELDRITCH_HOUSE 4 7 up
until idle
